    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Amanda Kimberly Daoud",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101157938667041045304/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkmJPCuvAO_ri48POzbRrwYoKbVaz2lOCoUfNjytvHq5_26A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "As a personal trainer with nearly a decade of experience in the industry, I can say with full confidence that Genevieve is one of the most exceptional massage therapists I’ve ever worked with. It’s not just about her skill as a massage therapist, but her deep understanding of the body,  movement, muscle function, and biomechanics that goes far beyond what you typically find with many massage therapists. A definite must try, you won’t regret it!",
        "time": 1760008138,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joshua Gascon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117034204637266956345/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI6rC1W3G9vyzcjMyS4oZA9v6BP8dUpEkLVDt1BeQ6sAhg_rg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Geneviève is an amazing massage therapist!\n\nI’ve been getting massages for 8 years, and I’ve never found a massage therapist that truly satisfied my needs. But now, I can finally say I’ve found the massage therapist for me!\n\nGeneviève is punctual, professional, and experienced. Every session, she adapts to my needs.\n\nMy needs usually include heavy pressure (deep tissue) and glutes/leg work.\n\nBefore Geneviève, I’ve never found someone who consistently provided enough pressure throughout the session or was comfortable working on my glutes.\n\nGeneviève is able to do exactly what I ask of her. The pressure she applies during our sessions is just perfect, and the work she does on my glutes is very comfortable and professional.\nHer experience shows in everything she does.\n\nThank you, Geneviève!",
        "time": 1760462620,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "James Horvath",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106445420553554463892/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBXI-Q5EaB5z-6wouNjnUpg3B-iNRd9JKyhKCUOXnPndnl9Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "★★★★★ Amazing Massage Therapy Experience with Geneviève!\n\nI had an incredible experience with Geneviève! From the moment I walked in, she made me feel comfortable and at ease. Her technique is both professional and intuitive—she knows exactly how to find and release tension while maintaining a relaxing atmosphere.\n\nShe took the time to understand my specific concerns and tailored the session perfectly. Whether you're looking for deep tissue work or pure relaxation, Geneviève is truly exceptional. I left feeling refreshed, pain-free, and looking forward to my next appointment.\n\nHighly recommend her to anyone in need of a top-tier massage therapist!",
        "time": 1743024730,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Danielle St Germain",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101630436114776106276/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1YzdBpF2kxR-3myBhcKxpR0aC9D6GsqI3edPojNT_Skp5fg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Genevieve is an absolute gift to all those searching for a massage therapist.\nThere is no other way to describe her, other than a healer.\nShe has the skill and pressure that I have dreamed about and searched for for years!\nShe massages you almost intuitively, but always following your requests.\nDo yourself a favor. Book now!\n(But also don't because it already fills up so fast!.. but do!!\nYou'll be greatful!",
        "time": 1742692837,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "L A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117390093300220079599/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX_symn7SpekwPaw--a6UUDQaP5uuhWPFeoKOQFkNuoKAdPp_zhlA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Wow! Geneviève is a massage magician. She was the perfect mix of relaxing, tension-releasing, soft and forceful without it ever being uncomfortable. I loved the overall experience, and it was a nice, quiet & peaceful environment to unwind. She is the first person to bring any sort of relief to my back which has been a major problem lately. I will definitely be back & I would highly recommend her to anyone in need of a massage. Merci encore Geneviève!!",
        "time": 1671111984,
        "translated": false
      }
